* PRNO SHA-512-DRNG (NIST SP 800-90A Hash_DRBG with SHA-512).
* The first test case is the NIST Hash_DRBG SHA-512 vector (Count #0)
* used by the Linux s390 prng self test. Other expected values come
* from a reference model that reproduces this vector.

*Testcase PRNO sha512-drng nist vector instantiate
sysclear
archmode z
r 1A0=00000001800000000000000000000200 # z/Arch restart PSW
r 1D0=0002000180000000000000000000DEAD # z/Arch pgm new PSW
r 300=00020001800000000000000000000000 # WAITPSW Enabled wait state PSW
r 200=C00F00000083C01F00000500C02F0000
r 210=0000C03F00000000C04F00000700C05F
r 220=00000030B93C0024B2220080EB0F0F00
r 230=0024B2B20300
r 700=6B50A7D8F8A55D7A3DF8BB40BCC3B722  # Seed material (entropy || nonce)
r 710=D8708DE67FDA010B03C4C84D72096F8C
r 720=3EC649CC6256D9FA31DB7A2904AAF025
runtest .1
*Compare
r 500.10
